oplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969060/extras/641d6b49247d33c0d66e1929a7fb45da.poster.avif?t=1731379852\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969060/extras/641d6b49247d33c0d66e1929a7fb45da.webm?t=1731379852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969060/extras/641d6b49247d33c0d66e1929a7fb45da.mp4?t=1731379852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfe6 Expand &amp; Upgrade Your Casino</strong></h2> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Buy new gambling games.<br></li><li> Slot machines, blackjack, poker, roulette, baccarat, craps...<br></li><li> Add new gaming areas, luxury suites, and amenities.<br></li><li> Personalize your casino\u2019s layout and design.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969060/extras/eb6bf0be66cd2d064158138e3179a4c9.poster.avif?t=1731379852\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969060/extras/eb6bf0be66cd2d064158138e3179a4c9.webm?t=1731379852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969060/extras/eb6bf0be66cd2d064158138e3179a4c9.mp4?t=1731379852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Explore The Island</strong></h2> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Discover hidden parts of the island.<br></li><li> Introduce bar games like darts and pool.<br></li><li> Include boat tours, scuba diving, and island excursions.</li></ul><br>Step into the shoes of a casino tycoon and turn your island into the ultimate entertainment paradise. In Casino Island Simulator, the stakes are high, the rewards are immense, and the adventure never ends. Are you ready to build your empire and become the king of the casino world?",
